  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nr₁ = 12%\n\nr₂ = 18%\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nEquivalent increase = [(1 + r₁/100) × (1 + r₂/100) - 1] × 100\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nEquivalent increase = [(1 + 12/100) × (1 + 18/100) - 1] × 100\n\n⇒ (1.12 × 1.18 - 1) × 100\n\n⇒ (1.3216 - 1) × 100\n\n⇒ 0.3216 × 100\n\n⇒ 32.16%\n\n**∴ Equivalent increase = 32.16%.**",
